der border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-lg">Health Reports</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Months of data, distilled into one page a vet can use</p></div></a></li></ul></article><article class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:items-start"><div class="lg:order-2"><p class="font-display text-sm text-accent">Service 02</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl"><a class="hover:text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-behavior-analysis/' ) ); ?>">AI Behavior Analysis</a></h2><p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Behavioural problems are the leading non-medical reason animals are surrendered to shelters. They are also the area where owners get the least reliable information, because behaviour happens when nobody is watching.</p><a class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-primary px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-foreground transition-transform duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-behavior-analysis/' ) ); ?>">Explore AI Behavior Analysis</a></div><ul class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:order-1"><li><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-behavior-analysis/anxiety-detection/' ) ); ?>"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-lg">Anxiety Detection</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Measure distress instead of guessing at it</p></div></a></li><li><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-behavior-analysis/aggression-prevention/' ) ); ?>"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-lg">Aggression Prevention</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Intercept the warning phase, not the incident</p></div></a></li><li><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-behavior-analysis/sleep-pattern-analysis/' ) ); ?>"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-lg">Sleep Pattern Analysis</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The most under-used diagnostic signal in pet care</p></div></a></li><li><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-behavior-analysis/social-behavior-insights/' ) ); ?>"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-lg">Social Behavior Insights</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">See the household dynamic your pets never show you</p></div></a></li><li><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-behavior-analysis/behavior-reports/' ) ); ?>"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-lg">Behavior Reports</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Documentation professionals can actually work from</p></div></a></li></ul></article><article class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:items-start"><div class=""><p class="font-display text-sm text-accent">Service 03</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl"><a class="hover:text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-pet-training/' ) ); ?>">AI Pet Training</a></h2><p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Most training advice is generic. It assumes an average animal, an average handler and an average environment, and then fails quietly when your dog is fearful, your schedule is irregular or your cues are inconsistent.</p><a class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-primary px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-foreground transition-transform duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-pet-training/' ) ); ?>">Explore AI Pet Training</a></div><ul class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2"><li><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-pet-training/puppy-training-ai/' ) ); ?>"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-lg">Puppy Training AI</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Get the first sixteen weeks right</p></div></a></li><li><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-pet-training/behavior-correction/' ) ); ?>"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-lg">Behavior Correction</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Replace the behaviour, do not just suppress it</p></div></a></li><li><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-pet-training/obedience-programs/' ) ); ?>"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-lg">Obedience Programs</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Reliability measured where it actually matters</p></div></a></li><li><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-pet-training/smart-training-devices/' ) ); ?>"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-lg">Smart Training Devices</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Perfect timing, every single repetition</p></div></a></li><li><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-pet-training/training-analytics/' ) ); ?>"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-lg">Training Analytics</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Know exactly why progress sped up or stalled</p></div></a></li></ul></article><article class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:items-start"><div class="lg:order-2"><p class="font-display text-sm text-accent">Service 04</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl"><a class="hover:text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/smart-pet-care/' ) ); ?>">Smart Pet Care</a></h2><p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Consistency is the foundation of animal wellbeing, and consistency is precisely what modern human schedules destroy. Late feeds, missed water changes and an overheated conservatory in July are ordinary household failures with real health consequences.</p><a class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-primary px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-foreground transition-transform duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/smart-pet-care/' ) ); ?>">Explore Smart Pet Care</a></div><ul class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:order-1"><li><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/smart-pet-care/smart-feeding-systems/' ) ); ?>"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-lg">Smart Feeding Systems</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The right food, the right pet, the right gram</p></div></a></li><li><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/smart-pet-care/hydration-monitoring/' ) ); ?>"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300